			},
			"options": {
				"mode": "markdown",
				"content": "Use the **Traces (Tempo)** and **Logs (Loki)** links in the dashboard header.\n\n- **Tempo (TraceQL):** `{ resource.service.name = \"ktb\" }` — narrow with `{ span.http.route = \"...\" }`, `{ status = error }`, or `{ duration > 2s }`. Span names include `app.run`, `app.runAs`, `queue.audio.transcribe`.\n- **Loki:** `{ service_name = \"ktb\" } |= \"http.access\"` for the edge access log; add `| json | status >= 500` to filter errors. `client.event` / `client.error` records come from browser telemetry. Access records carry `traceId` — click through to the matching Tempo trace via the derived field.\n- Spans carry `traceId`/`requestId` annotations; logs carry `traceId` when the request propagated a `traceparent`."
			}
		}
